{"result":"0"}
```

```catala
scope AllowanceWitness3:
  definition result
    equals
      (output of Allowance with { -- h: Household { -- status: Pensioner -- weekly_income: 0.0 -- has_dependants: true } }).allowance
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope AllowanceWitness3 --disable-warnings -F json
